							<tr data-row={s.id}><td><b>{s.label}</b></td><td class="mono">{s.k}σ</td><td class="mono">{s.pct}</td></tr>
						))}
					</tbody>
				</table>
				<p class="note">High alerts most often. IQR ignores the sensitivity: its bounds are always 1.5 × IQR beyond Q1 and Q3. Severity follows the size of the deviation (for standard deviation: Medium from 2, High from 3, Critical from 4).</p>
				<div class="card mini">
					<h3>The metric is the row count</h3>
